                <p>At present all vehicles have been equipped with GPS tracking System. There are 72 BCOs, 65 PVs, 07 Rakshak vehicles, 03 Highway mobiles and 10 intercepting vehicles i.e interceptors are functioning in the Bhadradri Kothagudem Department .</p>
                <ul class="contentList">
